 is the required place to continue. Advance one page within the assigned range without jumping straight to its last page.","22","225319def24304b46a8e9f276438b2b204205b51eb5b9eebb6d58e2d36c8ed88","23fb6bfb7182bd84efb1017cc229c87ee5c989ab4093480e0141c3ede61692e6","24 identifies a different printed role or position. Page 25 is the required place to continue. Resume at the unread facing page indicated by a bookmark and completed-page record.","24","25","258c79c59747f696d89cea157d5fd57e5eac8fe9","26 identifies a different printed role or position. Page 25 is the required place to continue. Resume at the unread facing page indicated by a bookmark and completed-page record.","26","26ef6778739a804fe27dfe1db999b756fe6ad8702433273923c49759ab809686","275452679eca0fa8efcbe6721f3baf81c4ae39d758c5af861e7c7e17107238c1","28457050306c4e4b021ad4bb94d913171ec0424cced61f8d58f38526f01c1d7b","2ae7c4c2d7c02093b03ce20126119e0c6e1bd9904f7dec76816ddb8da7507374","3 does not satisfy the complete evidence. The spaces separate My, dog, can and swim: four words.","329f7701f8db236d0e1fa9eefc5020470cc8ec4778379f8834b3ac31fc6cb449","34e658482582d293aaf84b14c660daf45a5fd9037a59922126fcc210f0eaa44e","39a0f74717ff10075aa7b308fbb876ac192ef18223c0d0f2fee3ad08358bc9f0","3a438940e0688324a8cc531163d2f1862b8708d64a9ee31c1b63f617f293a2fb","3f23ff436d09537b510649fa1a78faa7960bc4843416a70f104081e9195657b8","3ff7594931de3587d1a705eb5520f5c166f86594e43774f77b30bc226e90599c","4 does not satisfy the complete evidence. Quotation marks, comma and full stop attach to words; the five words are Please, wait, called, Mr and Fox.","4 identifies a different printed role or position. Page 3 is the required place to continue. Move from the finished left-hand page to the facing right-hand page.","4 identifies a different printed role or position. Page 6 is the required place to continue. Turn to the next spread after completing both visible pages.","426fec4f52e2d6d587c3c90734caf2f560eb8eb247a99d1285f110e4cb855025","43f897a48f