nal vowel-team spelling.","Retain all three consonants of /spr/ while discriminating a cluster differing only in its third sound.","Retell repeats telling; it need not change the characters or forget details.","Retreat moves back; proceed and approach continue movement forward or toward something.","Return gives the borrowed book back; lend describes the owner’s earlier action.","Return to the left edge on the next line rather than continue along the margin.","Returns the removed part ball, rather than the remaining part foot.","Returns the removed part bow, rather than the remaining part rain.","Returns the removed part box, rather than the remaining part mail.","Returns the removed part brush, rather than the remaining part tooth.","Returns the removed part cup, rather than the remaining part cake.","Returns the removed part flower, rather than the remaining part sun.","Returns the removed part mail, rather than the remaining part box.","Returns the removed part rain, rather than the remaining part bow.","Returns the removed part snow, rather than the remaining part man.","Returns the removed part sun, rather than the remaining part flower.","Returns to an earlier word on the first line.","Returns to packing after the story has already described going home.","Returns to the beginning of the sentence.","Returns to the journey’s beginning after the family has gone home.","Reusable bags can replace many bags used only once.","Reusable combines again with able to be used; unusable means it cannot be used.","Reuse gives the same box another use; buying another replaces it.","Reverses the action by choosing stopping rather than running.","Reverses the already supplied bread-and-jam steps instead of continuing.","Reverses the event order.","Reverses the two stated events.","Reverses which narrator describes its own action.","Reverses which object has the other.","Reversing the comparison words preserves which plant is taller.","Rewrite repeats writing; hiding and reading