aterials and the teaching.","The message appreciates the team’s patience.","The message asks the neighbour to attend.","The message distinguishes the cover design from the sticker and its position.","The message expresses appreciation for making room.","The message gives the requested family news.","The message is written before the card is enclosed and posted.","The message keeps the two kinds of seed and their different outcomes.","The message preserves the visiting time and display rule.","The message reports arrival for the visit, not its end.","The message supplies the needed item and date.","The message thanks both groups for the correct completed jobs.","The message thanks the completed protection and gives the update.","The message thanks the friend for teaching.","The milk ___ cold when I drank it.","The mill sits ___ a stream.","The missing ___ belonged between the two corners of the picture.","The missing coat is green with a silver zip and striped cuffs.","The missing gloves ___ found behind the changing-room bench.","The missing gloves were found behind the changing-room bench. Build the missing word.","The missing part belonged between the two corners of the picture. Build the missing word.","The model bridge held eight coins before it bent.","The model is made of wood.","The moon bakery is an imagined setting with impossible delivery.","The moon rose above the sea. does not satisfy the complete evidence. A moon speaking to a person is fantasy; moonrise and moving reflections can occur.","The moon rose above the sea.","The moon whispered Lea’s name.","The morning market has fewer shoppers than before sunrise.","The mountain chose to walk to the coast.","The mouse crept ___, without making a sound.","The mouse was very small: it was ___.","The movement of drops explains the drainage action.","The moving feet identify the ladder as the object that slipped.","The muddy path stopped us from finishing the walk.","The museum is in ___.","The museum takes car